  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding educational opportunities for School-Aged children through generating income and raising awareness among vulnerable parents in Northern Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.Increase the income-generating capacity of vulnerable parents 2.Development and operation of sustainable and profitable business models 3.Enhanced parental awareness of children&apos;s educational importance</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to provide vocational skills training (sewing refresher courses) and soft skills training (leadership education, accounting education, communication skills) to vulnerable parents in Northern Uganda to help them establish a stable financial foundation. Additionally, education will be provided to parents on their role in ensuring continuous educational opportunities for their children. This will encourage parents to go beyond simply paying school fees and take an active interest in their children&apos;s learning, participating directly in the school&apos;s teaching and learning activities. By supporting parental education and community advocacy activities, the goal is to ensure and expand sustainable educational opportunities for children of school age from vulnerable communities.1. &#xC790;&#xB140; &#xAD50;&#xC721; &#xC9C0;&#xC6D0;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xD559;&#xBD80;&#xBAA8;&#xC758; &#xACBD;&#xC81C;&#xC801; &#xAE30;&#xBC18; &#xAC15;&#xD654;
2. &#xD559;&#xBD80;&#xBAA8;&#xC758; &#xC778;&#xC2DD; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC790;&#xB140; &#xAD50;&#xC721; &#xCC38;&#xC5EC; &#xBC0F; &#xC9C0;&#xC6D0; &#xC99D;&#xAC00;</narrative>
  </description>
